56
00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.180
I do think because we're moving into, like,

57
00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.530
Meatless Mondays and the plant-based movement

58
00:01:50.530 --> 00:01:52.620
and mental health is so prevalent, like,

59
00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.580
why are we not fighting for, like,

60
00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.630
