61
00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:57.970
We should.

62
00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.410
Literally, Sunday, no one's on their phones.

63
00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:01.330
No responding to texts.

64
00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:02.370
No Instagram posts.

65
00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:03.203
Let's start it.

66
00:02:03.203 --> 00:02:04.036
Let's start it.

67
00:02:04.036 --> 00:02:04.869
I'm serious.

68
00:02:06.242 --> 00:02:07.810
There is a shift,

69
00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:12.550
