76
00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:31.614
Totally.

77
00:02:31.614 --> 00:02:32.447
I love that.

78
00:02:32.447 --> 00:02:33.493
(audience applauding)

79
00:02:33.493 --> 00:02:36.000
Oh, what a dream come true.

80
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.802
She is the best.

81
00:02:37.802 --> 00:02:40.385 line:15%
(upbeat music)

